	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Doleo vices meas, doctissime et charissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quod <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>propter intempestivas et ingentes negotiorum undas non licuit <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>facere, quod valde optabam; peregre enim profecturo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cras necessum fuit ex multis per totum triduum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut me labyrinthis extricarem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quare vestros pro more <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>meo non licuit excipere, non circumducere et spectanda <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>prebere future nostrę urbis horrenda diviciarum et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>lauticiarum monstra.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rogo igitur, ut apud optimos <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>viros me excuses et idem etiam <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> dicas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Proinde non licuit, ut tibi, quod volui, ex multis vel <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aliquid significarem; resarciam hoc peccatum proximo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tabellario.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Filius tuus honeste et pie vivit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ostium apud me, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tuus in me amor et filii honestissima conversatio, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>filio omni hora est apertum; eum ultro currentem ad <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>omnia honestatis fastigia calcar addere non cessabo.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Hoc te celare non possum, quod brevi futura <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sit <persName ref="p1283">Gesneri</persName> ad tolerabiles labores vocatio.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quare <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>consilium est, ut, si vobis vir ille sit honori et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>utilitati, ut credo eum esse utilissimum, ut eum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ita tractetis, ne vobis ereptus desideretur, neque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>grave est, si idem <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> dicas.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dixissem hoc <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ipsum vestris, si <persName ref="p19043">Fuggeri</persName> et mea ad abitum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>adornatio non impedissent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Vix credere potestis, quam me <persName ref="p8011">Gvalteri</persName> nostri literę <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>exhilerarint.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ambio eius amicitiam et probe memini <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>eum mihi visum <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponę</placeName>, sed principis mei import<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>una negocia, que humeris meis rebus tantis imp..., <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>non admittebant futurę consuetudinis iacere fundam<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>enta.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Non licuit cum scribere ad eum; sed posthac <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>creberrimas dabo <persName ref="p1283">Gesner</persName> literas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Rogo, ut ad filium meum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName>Raphaelem</persName> scribat; mire enim ei placuit, cum <placeName ref="l587">Tyguri</placeName> esset.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Filii res ut habent, ex <persName>Petro</persName> nostro cognovisti; hunc, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ut reditum brevi paret, adhortare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> dicas me ex eius ędibus piscem magnum recepisse, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sed ut ipse oculos tantum et non ventrem pavit, ita ego <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>spectaculum hoc ut remittam curabo; utinam liceret ad v(os) <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>voluptatis et refectionis gratia pisces <placeName ref="l619">Bavaricos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>pingues et in deliciis principum habitos remittere <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et tale quippiam ex <placeName ref="l587">Tygurino</placeName> lacu accipere; sed operam (dabo), <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>quod prestari poterit.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Hodie comitia <placeName ref="l2286">Landsbergensia</placeName> celebrari coepta sunt; <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l1703">Bambergensis</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1030">Herbipolensis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l361">Nurnberga</placeName> per suos <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>illuc profecti nuptias vel ad minus sponsalicia <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>cum illo <placeName>Bavarico</placeName> scorto, foedus intelligo <placeName ref="l2286">Landspergium</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>contrahere cupientes.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Circulus, ut vocant, <placeName ref="l2481">Svevicus</placeName> <placeName ref="l513">Ulme</placeName> comitia celebrat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Puto dei gratia fieri posse, ut militum congregatio, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>que iam aliquot annis ad faciendum delectum cum <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>magno <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> periculo fuit impune, prohibeatur.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/><persName>Polwiler</persName> namque circa circum <persName>Hercyniam</persName> sylvam <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>militem conscribit, sed ad <persName ref="p8375">Anglię</persName> regem exercitus <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>duos et 1000 equites ducturum protulit; interim <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>nemo novit, quorsum hec... putida tendant.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Inter <persName>Pfaltzgravios</persName>, <persName>Clevensem</persName>, <persName>Hessum</persName>, <persName>Wirtenbergensem</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>et <persName>Badensem</persName> foedus pactum cum magno religionis <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>emolumento spero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/><persName ref="p18477">Rex Ferdinandus</persName> <persName ref="p18593">Turcam</persName> propulsavit suo more, <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>neque gri auditur de ulteriore expeditione.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/>Pecunia imperii spero frustra ambitur, quia dominus <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>his opus habet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Quidam doctor <persName ref="p4183">Iacob Andreę</persName> libellum divulgasse <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>dicitur de reconcilianda sacramentaria concordia.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z30"/>A multis laudatur, a me nondum lectus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z31"/>Turca vivit et quidem melius, quam nobis prosit.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Rex <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>ovile expurgavit, oves tamen nullas nisi paucas <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>quasdam sine vellere reperit.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z34"/>De <placeName ref="l569">Wormatiensi</placeName> colloquio nihil ausim asseverare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z35"/>Literę ad bibliopolam <placeName ref="l546">Viennensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Raphael Hofhalter.</note> certo perferentur.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z36"/>Recte facis, quod filium ex hac malorum <persName>Lerna</persName> evocas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Ocys<lb xml:id="p2z37"/>sime 10. augusti anno domini 57.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2856">G<lb xml:id="p2z38"/>[ereon]</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">D. <pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/><persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>theologo eximio et <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>amico charissimo<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
